OL,3,GNEWSADriver caught watching an adult
OL,4,Avideo at the wheel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver caught watching an adult video
OL,7,Fwhile behind the wheel, cloned cars and
OL,8,Funinsured motorists are just some of
OL,9,Fthe cases being dealt with by a
OL,10,Fspecialist roads policing unit in
OL,11,FSurrey.
OL,13,FBBC South East had exclusive access to
OL,14,Fan operation involving the Vanguard
OL,15,FRoad Safety Team to see the range of
OL,16,Foffences they are tackling.
OL,18,FThe unit, which uses marked and
OL,19,Funmarked cars and motorbikes, was set
OL,20,Fup in 2022 to target serious road
OL,21,Fcrime.
