OL,6,FWe joined them during a dedicated
OL,7,Foperation targeting known hotspot areas
OL,8,Fto get an insight into the types of
OL,9,Foffending taking place on our roads,
OL,10,Fafter the government recently consulted
OL,11,Fon tougher penalties for a raft of
OL,12,Fmotoring offences.
